  "description": "Body Snatcher Frame We haven’t created a Flatland frame since our popular DTT Flat frame a few years ago, but the timing is right! We’ve teamed up with some serious flatland shredders, and connoisseurs from around the world to create the Body Snatcher Flatland Frame. Working painstakingly on geometry, strength and flex to handle the different abuse that a flatland frame takes then a traditional BMX frame. Frame details include the custom Subrosa chain stay yoke to increase the side to side strength and reduce flex along with built in chain tensioners to keep your rear wheel in the perfect spot.",
